<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-28T13:18:38.484Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:18:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Rapid Support Forces carried out a drone strike in Nyala that killed at least 21 people and injured 40, also knocking out power in southeast Sudan. In the Blue Nile, the Sudanese Armed Forces repelled a fresh RSF and SPLM-N assault, seizing 15 combat vehicles. Women under siege are increasingly acting as frontline responders to meet basic needs as the war grinds on. World leaders are urging urgent aid access as the United Nations warns of a looming famine risk. The conflict caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168663&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOeklWd1RmSzlrVkcyZjljUW9FUEx4aDFKM0tEX25VaU1PSE5JTlBiUGpLMDVGcnZIa2JpekhwZHB3cjZnU0JZMTBSTVJxcTkxWHpqY3ZkYXJDOWdFNndnU1pkQmVGQlYzRkpMTDRZOHNPYTdxQnF1eTFoczBMXzFEN1lYVy03QU9QaFprZjREc0JBV0FycWI2ZWdBUFBoajloZm1ydDB5RmxLdEFpVlBMUldlUzY?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPUk43d1lISlFiS2U5LXNjN3BVRWtfVGI1ZTIwMTNmYUJyN2pNQzQyNDk0NTZsSTBpQnAxNnlVc0ZReVVtT1IyMG1aaDJoeTVOOHJUekZwQy1Bcm1PdXE2akEwbnFyZHFveE5aVGxIbEsteXZpWDdfX1ZucHdZejdSejloWGYxb1FtWEVEVW1jZWt6VHJOS3A2OE9SVmYzQkV6a1daUTc3V0dhTmpfS1VDbGxvSFU3N2xDTFpJS3BZcVdzUmZfclE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNTWR6clJtemFRTk5hVGxzaDlmSWxKbDhDV2phbDlQUHVqX3FOTDR4UzhlLWtVN3hGR0F1eTJOc1ZxTy1xX05HdFVJNWhqUktzNjFCbTd3MjZaamtUWndpa29lWXVYd3p4Rm1PVVBaV3ZTWFN0WmFidXhxMWFhdHpNd2xLUEJycEdKS3JDM3dnMmh6cGYzejJ0UWxRZVo5cEVkVkFR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9JNTNFWGxoVzY4N25oRHVzd2xSbjBtNWJkT04zV2g0VGEwRWdVdGdVS1BhTm9IV2xQM0x